     fhir:div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</b></p><a name=\"AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor\"> </a><a name=\"hcAHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Language: en</p></div><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CNTR<a name=\"AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-CNTR\"> </a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">UMN<a name=\"AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-UMN\"> </a></td><td>Use My Name</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient do not want a pronoun to be used but instead use their name</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">PSIN<a name=\"AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-PSIN\"> </a></td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient would like to specify a value that is not listed above</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
